# Unblessed: retained failed frames during cleanup (#1734); first blessing awaits human review.
# cleanup-retained-state: `deep(3)` raises from four `deep` frames, each
# holding a ten-item List, and nothing catches it. `go`'s `finally` block
# runs while those failed frames stay retained, so when the Fuel cap stops
# the Run inside it, its state counts all four frames, not just `go`'s.
# The next Pump finishes the cleanup from where it stopped, and the error
# ends the Run.

